1
00:00:46,860 --> 00:00:52,500
=The Outlaw=

2
00:00:52,500 --> 00:00:53,682
(This story is entirely fictional.)

3
00:00:53,682 --> 00:00:55,900
(All settings are imaginary.)

4
00:00:55,900 --> 00:00:58,900
=Episode 17=

5
00:01:00,280 --> 00:01:01,600
And I'm here today

6
00:01:03,280 --> 00:01:04,820
to solve this problem for everyone.

7
00:01:05,800 --> 00:01:06,400
Oh, perfect timing.

8
00:01:07,600 --> 00:01:09,720
Let's welcome my new partner.

9
00:01:18,630 --> 00:01:19,600
Mian.

10
00:01:20,680 --> 00:01:21,480
You again.

11
00:01:29,400 --> 00:01:29,870
Everyone.

12
00:01:30,760 --> 00:01:31,560
I'll say just one thing.

13
00:01:33,200 --> 00:01:35,280
Ms. Layla has my full support.

14
00:01:35,800 --> 00:01:37,300
If you support Ms. Layla,

15
00:01:38,200 --> 00:01:40,520
the Songcai family's business

16
00:01:40,930 --> 00:01:41,720
is under my protection.

17
00:01:42,960 --> 00:01:43,640
Otherwise,

18
00:01:44,280 --> 00:01:46,160
the Songcai family

19
00:01:46,840 --> 00:01:47,840
won't exist in Langia anymore.

20
00:01:51,000 --> 00:01:52,590
We were worried

21
00:01:52,590 --> 00:01:54,240
Mr. Natuo and Mian

22
00:01:54,240 --> 00:01:55,080
would turn against each other.

23
00:01:55,080 --> 00:01:57,020
We didn't know how the group
would move forward.

24
00:01:57,400 --> 00:01:58,440
That's a relief.

25
00:02:01,520 --> 00:02:02,250
Since

26
00:02:02,400 --> 00:02:04,880
Mr. Mian is willing to help,

27
00:02:05,160 --> 00:02:07,440
things will be much easier.

28
00:02:11,280 --> 00:02:11,970
Exactly.

29
00:02:13,450 --> 00:02:13,970
Good.

30
00:02:14,160 --> 00:02:15,080
Let's vote, then.

31
00:02:15,680 --> 00:02:16,950
Those who support
the family head's motion,

32
00:02:18,040 --> 00:02:18,700
raise your hands.

33
00:02:21,440 --> 00:02:21,960
Go ahead.

34
00:02:23,480 --> 00:02:24,600
I dare you!

35
00:03:12,040 --> 00:03:12,480
Alright.

36
00:03:13,560 --> 00:03:15,000
The board has voted unanimously.

37
00:03:15,920 --> 00:03:16,480
Natuo.

38
00:03:17,520 --> 00:03:18,720
As of today,

39
00:03:19,600 --> 00:03:20,760
I'm the new president

40
00:03:21,800 --> 00:03:23,040
of the Songcai Group.

41
00:03:24,400 --> 00:03:25,360
This mine

42
00:03:26,360 --> 00:03:27,040
is mine now.

43
00:03:30,080 --> 00:03:31,400
You actually played me?

44
00:03:36,520 --> 00:03:37,120
What's the rush?

45
00:03:38,280 --> 00:03:39,360
The game just started.

46
00:03:40,170 --> 00:03:40,920
Your money.

47
00:03:41,650 --> 00:03:42,400
Your power.

48
00:03:43,280 --> 00:03:44,800
Everyone around you.

49
00:03:45,880 --> 00:03:47,560
I'll take them away, one by one.

50
00:03:48,680 --> 00:03:50,220
When you have nothing left,

51
00:03:51,200 --> 00:03:52,600
you'll finally know

52
00:03:53,000 --> 00:03:53,940
what it means

53
00:03:55,240 --> 00:03:56,480
to wish you were dead.

54
00:03:57,660 --> 00:03:58,720
In your dreams.

55
00:04:15,800 --> 00:04:16,280
Fine.

56
00:04:17,650 --> 00:04:18,320
Fine.

57
00:04:19,690 --> 00:04:20,200
You...

58
00:04:21,160 --> 00:04:22,180
Just wait and see.

59
00:04:26,830 --> 00:04:27,520
Ms. Layla.

60
00:04:28,400 --> 00:04:29,000
I did

61
00:04:29,560 --> 00:04:30,360
what I promised you.

62
00:04:32,320 --> 00:04:33,520
Thank you, Mr. Mian.

63
00:04:34,360 --> 00:04:35,440
I won't forget

64
00:04:37,880 --> 00:04:38,960
what I promised you, either.

65
00:04:41,960 --> 00:04:43,320
I look forward to working
with all of you.

66
00:04:51,790 --> 00:04:52,720
Get over here, all of you!

67
00:04:53,360 --> 00:04:55,440
I'm taking Mian down now.

68
00:04:55,440 --> 00:04:56,080
Got it.

69
00:04:56,080 --> 00:04:57,440
Let's go.

70
00:04:57,440 --> 00:04:57,920
Move!

71
00:04:58,280 --> 00:04:58,760
Move!

72
00:04:58,760 --> 00:04:59,200
Go!

73
00:04:59,200 --> 00:04:59,600
Move!

74
00:05:19,050 --> 00:05:19,690
Natuo.

75
00:05:20,120 --> 00:05:20,920
What are you doing?

76
00:05:21,280 --> 00:05:21,880
Today,

77
00:05:22,480 --> 00:05:24,080
I'll show you all

78
00:05:24,480 --> 00:05:25,540
who's tougher,

79
00:05:25,680 --> 00:05:26,680
me or Mian.

80
00:05:27,320 --> 00:05:28,560
You're out of your league.

81
00:05:37,840 --> 00:05:38,680
Get them!

82
00:05:55,280 --> 00:05:56,440
Get over here, now!

83
00:05:57,040 --> 00:05:57,720
These guys

84
00:05:58,040 --> 00:05:59,120
are trying to take my mine.

85
00:05:59,840 --> 00:06:01,080
Kill them all!

86
00:06:01,960 --> 00:06:02,760
Anyone who won't fight,

87
00:06:03,480 --> 00:06:04,520
look at those dead men from last night.

88
00:06:04,880 --> 00:06:06,040
That's your fate.

89
00:06:11,890 --> 00:06:12,560
Mian.

90
00:06:13,280 --> 00:06:13,980
Today,

91
00:06:14,320 --> 00:06:16,050
I'll send you to your grave.

92
00:06:16,220 --> 00:06:16,760
Boss.

93
00:06:16,760 --> 00:06:17,440
Let's fight them!

94
00:06:18,710 --> 00:06:19,800
Don't turn on each other.

95
00:06:20,800 --> 00:06:23,120
We've all suffered in this mine.

96
00:06:23,240 --> 00:06:24,100
Think how many of your

97
00:06:24,760 --> 00:06:25,680
closest brothers

98
00:06:26,200 --> 00:06:28,450
that monster killed last night.

99
00:06:29,902 --> 00:06:31,110
♪Dust rises along the border♪

100
00:06:31,110 --> 00:06:35,680
Pick them up!

101
00:06:35,990 --> 00:06:36,900
That monster

102
00:06:37,400 --> 00:06:39,080
Natuo treats you like cattle,

103
00:06:39,840 --> 00:06:41,000
and you still do his dirty work.

104
00:06:41,400 --> 00:06:43,080
Can you face your brothers
who died last night?

105
00:06:45,960 --> 00:06:47,280
What are you standing around for?

106
00:06:48,120 --> 00:06:49,080
Kill him!

107
00:06:49,800 --> 00:06:50,840
Follow me.

108
00:06:50,840 --> 00:06:51,920
You won't be slaves
in this mine anymore.

109
00:06:52,680 --> 00:06:53,600
You'll all have a share

110
00:06:53,960 --> 00:06:55,350
in this mine.

111
00:06:55,350 --> 00:06:56,440
♪The bonds we forged stay in my heart♪

112
00:06:56,444 --> 00:06:57,706
♪Plots and schemes are everywhere♪

113
00:06:58,380 --> 00:06:59,500
What, you scared to fight?

114
00:06:59,990 --> 00:07:01,110
Kill him now!

115
00:07:01,937 --> 00:07:03,200
♪So what if fate mocks me?♪

116
00:07:03,200 --> 00:07:04,440
♪This fight will defy fate itself♪

117
00:07:04,440 --> 00:07:05,320
Fellow miners.

118
00:07:05,320 --> 00:07:06,840
From now on, we follow Mian.

119
00:07:07,160 --> 00:07:11,080
Mian!

120
00:07:11,081 --> 00:07:15,000
Mian!

121
00:07:15,000 --> 00:07:16,190
Boss, things have changed.

122
00:07:16,190 --> 00:07:17,560
Fall back.

123
00:07:17,560 --> 00:07:22,845
Mian!

124
00:07:22,846 --> 00:07:28,130
Mian!

125
00:08:00,520 --> 00:08:02,200
The brothers from the Blaze Gang
have been following me.

126
00:08:02,790 --> 00:08:04,080
They've had nowhere to stay.

127
00:08:04,400 --> 00:08:05,750
They've been living rough.

128
00:08:06,200 --> 00:08:07,390
I want them settled here.

129
00:08:09,240 --> 00:08:11,120
You're really making yourself
at home.

130
00:08:11,600 --> 00:08:13,680
My miners are now your men.

131
00:08:14,600 --> 00:08:15,800
What's next?

132
00:08:19,200 --> 00:08:21,440
Don't tell me you're taking
my mine too.

133
00:08:21,840 --> 00:08:23,210
It's your mine to begin with.

134
00:08:23,210 --> 00:08:24,400
Why would I take it from you?

135
00:08:26,840 --> 00:08:27,480
It's fine.

136
00:08:28,600 --> 00:08:30,040
As long as you're mine,

137
00:08:32,720 --> 00:08:33,760
what's mine is yours.

138
00:08:40,520 --> 00:08:42,720
(I wonder how Mona's doing
with the evidence.)

139
00:09:08,190 --> 00:09:09,000
Don't worry.

140
00:09:09,600 --> 00:09:10,280
They're gone.

141
00:09:11,320 --> 00:09:12,730
Come help me find the ledger.

142
00:09:16,640 --> 00:09:19,000
I checked Natuo, Dashan,

143
00:09:19,000 --> 00:09:20,100
and Suowen's accounts.

144
00:09:20,440 --> 00:09:21,920
Thirty percent of their monthly income

145
00:09:21,920 --> 00:09:24,000
was sent to an anonymous account.

146
00:09:24,320 --> 00:09:24,920
Thirty percent?

147
00:09:26,480 --> 00:09:27,760
That's their tribute to Mian.

148
00:09:33,320 --> 00:09:34,320
You search here first.

149
00:09:56,840 --> 00:09:57,440
Hey.

150
00:09:57,440 --> 00:09:57,880
Found it.

151
00:09:57,880 --> 00:09:58,560
This is it.

152
00:09:59,560 --> 00:10:00,320
Thirty percent again.

153
00:10:00,630 --> 00:10:01,120
Look.

154
00:10:08,240 --> 00:10:08,970
I can't read this.

155
00:10:10,330 --> 00:10:11,320
I forgot.

156
00:10:11,320 --> 00:10:11,770
Let me.

157
00:10:19,200 --> 00:10:20,240
This account

158
00:10:20,800 --> 00:10:23,320
has transactions with Natuo's
other accounts.

159
00:10:25,200 --> 00:10:27,200
Based on these transactions,

160
00:10:28,160 --> 00:10:29,120
it looks like all the money

161
00:10:29,120 --> 00:10:30,400
went to Grand Royal.

162
00:10:31,400 --> 00:10:32,000
Grand Royal?

163
00:10:33,360 --> 00:10:34,600
So that's where they pay tribute

164
00:10:35,240 --> 00:10:36,240
to Mian.

165
00:10:37,020 --> 00:10:39,720
Looks like we'll have to
visit Grand Royal ourselves.

166
00:10:45,840 --> 00:10:46,520
Dad.

167
00:10:46,880 --> 00:10:48,000
Why did you hand the mine

168
00:10:48,000 --> 00:10:49,120
over to that woman, Layla?

169
00:10:49,120 --> 00:10:50,340
Are you so sick you've lost your mind?

170
00:10:53,320 --> 00:10:54,400
Watch your mouth.

171
00:10:55,280 --> 00:10:56,560
She's your stepmother.

172
00:10:57,560 --> 00:10:59,000
You're always acting crazy.

173
00:10:59,000 --> 00:11:00,440
That's no way for a family head to act.

174
00:11:00,960 --> 00:11:03,660
How can I trust you to run the group?

175
00:11:04,440 --> 00:11:05,840
But I'm your son.

176
00:11:06,360 --> 00:11:07,440
So what?

177
00:11:08,200 --> 00:11:10,020
Ever since I gave you the mine,

178
00:11:10,440 --> 00:11:12,400
you've been acting recklessly.

179
00:11:13,480 --> 00:11:14,520
I won't sit by

180
00:11:14,520 --> 00:11:16,400
and watch you squander
everything I built.

181
00:11:17,200 --> 00:11:18,880
From now on, keep yourself
in check.

182
00:11:18,880 --> 00:11:21,140
Do as your stepmother says.

183
00:11:24,480 --> 00:11:25,680
I'm still calling you Dad

184
00:11:27,240 --> 00:11:28,760
because this is your last chance.

185
00:11:32,800 --> 00:11:33,900
Take back your decision,

186
00:11:34,520 --> 00:11:35,560
and I'll let you live.

187
00:11:36,060 --> 00:11:36,850
You're insane.

188
00:11:37,360 --> 00:11:38,720
I'm your father!

189
00:11:38,720 --> 00:11:39,320
So what?

190
00:11:42,520 --> 00:11:43,320
If you support me,

191
00:11:43,880 --> 00:11:44,820
you're my dad.

192
00:11:45,520 --> 00:11:46,080
Otherwise,

193
00:11:46,640 --> 00:11:48,000
you're just an old geezer.

194
00:11:50,640 --> 00:11:51,660
Do you really think

195
00:11:51,930 --> 00:11:53,080
your paralysis

196
00:11:53,840 --> 00:11:55,060
was just an accident?

197
00:11:56,840 --> 00:11:58,020
What did you say?

198
00:11:59,520 --> 00:12:00,960
That crash five years ago,

199
00:12:01,720 --> 00:12:02,440
I was the one

200
00:12:03,280 --> 00:12:04,750
who had Jia cause it.

201
00:12:05,720 --> 00:12:06,800
(You're taking forever.)

202
00:12:06,800 --> 00:12:07,620
(What are you doing?)

203
00:12:08,200 --> 00:12:09,220
(I've been waiting forever.)

204
00:12:35,520 --> 00:12:37,160
It was never an accident.

205
00:12:39,480 --> 00:12:40,760
You ungrateful son.

206
00:12:40,760 --> 00:12:42,560
I'm your father.

207
00:12:44,840 --> 00:12:46,130
When you trusted outsiders

208
00:12:47,320 --> 00:12:48,200
and turned on me,

209
00:12:48,200 --> 00:12:49,240
you should've seen this coming.

210
00:12:51,600 --> 00:12:52,980
You were lucky to survive.

211
00:12:53,680 --> 00:12:54,320
But all these years,

212
00:12:54,640 --> 00:12:56,240
I waited for you to beg me

213
00:12:56,480 --> 00:12:57,760
to take care of you till the end.

214
00:12:57,760 --> 00:12:59,180
I waited for you to wise up.

215
00:12:59,180 --> 00:13:00,120
You ungrateful son.

216
00:13:00,950 --> 00:13:01,920
You ungrateful brat!

217
00:13:01,920 --> 00:13:02,960
Why do you insist on

218
00:13:02,960 --> 00:13:04,440
walking right into the blade?

219
00:13:23,830 --> 00:13:25,220
♪Dust rises along the border♪

220
00:13:25,220 --> 00:13:26,520
♪Out here, life and death are routine♪

221
00:13:26,520 --> 00:13:27,880
♪Spent shells fall, last echoes ring♪

222
00:13:27,880 --> 00:13:29,150
♪Brothers yesterday, foes today♪

223
00:13:29,150 --> 00:13:30,500
♪Fate's blade falls, who can stop it?♪

224
00:13:30,500 --> 00:13:31,850
♪Against the tide, I never bow♪

225
00:13:31,850 --> 00:13:33,210
♪The night is long, the road unclear♪

226
00:13:33,210 --> 00:13:34,850
♪My life is mine to bear♪

227
00:13:34,850 --> 00:13:37,490
♪In chaos, a bloodied titan rages♪

228
00:13:37,490 --> 00:13:40,150
♪I crush the thorns and reach the dawn♪

229
00:13:40,150 --> 00:13:42,460
♪I fight back from death on all fronts♪

230
00:13:42,460 --> 00:13:44,060
♪My fate is mine to command♪

231
00:13:44,060 --> 00:13:45,040
♪Who dares stand in my way?♪

232
00:13:45,040 --> 00:13:46,450
♪I weave through storms of bullets♪

233
00:13:46,450 --> 00:13:47,830
♪I fight through flashing blades♪

234
00:13:47,830 --> 00:13:49,080
♪Blood stains the whole land red♪

235
00:13:49,080 --> 00:13:50,560
♪The bonds we forged stay in my heart♪

236
00:13:50,560 --> 00:13:51,840
♪Plots and schemes are everywhere♪

237
00:13:51,840 --> 00:13:53,080
♪Deceit runs deep, hard to see through♪

238
00:13:53,080 --> 00:13:54,480
♪Every step is planned. I won't retreat♪

239
00:13:54,480 --> 00:13:55,880
♪A spark ignites in the dark♪

240
00:13:55,880 --> 00:13:57,210
♪So what if fate mocks me?♪

241
00:13:57,210 --> 00:13:58,600
♪This fight will defy fate itself♪

242
00:13:58,600 --> 00:13:59,850
♪Break every shackle, break every lock♪

243
00:13:59,850 --> 00:14:02,820
♪Anger burns inside my chest♪

244
00:14:02,820 --> 00:14:05,360
♪No more fear, no more losing my way♪

245
00:14:05,360 --> 00:14:07,960
♪With blood and sweat, I forge my glory♪

246
00:14:07,960 --> 00:14:10,770
♪In this world of chaos,
I carve out a road to brighter days♪

247
00:14:10,770 --> 00:14:13,950
♪My legend, I'll write
every chapter myself♪

248
00:14:17,920 --> 00:14:20,410
♪In chaos, a bloodied titan rages♪

249
00:14:20,410 --> 00:14:23,030
♪I crush the thorns and reach the dawn♪

250
00:14:23,030 --> 00:14:25,340
♪I fight back from death on all fronts♪

251
00:14:25,340 --> 00:14:28,440
♪My fate is mine to command.
Who dares stand in my way?♪
